%% 图 3-2 签到签退时序图
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as 学生
    participant V as 前端
    participant RH as ReservationHandler
    participant LS as LifecycleService
    participant RR as ReservationRepo
    participant HK as CompositeHooks<br/>(信用+通知)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    U->>V: 点击「签到」
    V->>RH: POST /api/reservations/:id/checkin
    RH->>LS: Checkin(uid, id)
    LS->>RR: GetByID(id)
    RR->>DB: SELECT ... WHERE id=$1
    DB-->>RR: 预约记录
    RR-->>LS: Reservation
    LS->>LS: 校验: 本人? pending?<br/>now ∈ [开始-15m, 开始+15m]?
    alt 校验失败
        LS-->>RH: 错误(403/409/400)
        RH-->>V: 错误响应
    else 校验通过
        LS->>RR: UpdateStatus(pending→checked_in, checkin_at=now)
        RR->>DB: UPDATE ... WHERE status='pending'
        DB-->>RR: 生效
        RR-->>LS: true
        LS-->>RH: 成功
        RH-->>V: {action: checked_in}
        V-->>U: 状态更新为「使用中」
    end

    U->>V: 学习结束点击「签退」
    V->>RH: POST /api/reservations/:id/checkout
    RH->>LS: Checkout(uid, id)
    LS->>RR: UpdateStatus(checked_in→completed, checkout_at=now)
    RR->>DB: UPDATE ... WHERE status IN ('checked_in','temp_leave')
    DB-->>RR: 生效
    LS->>HK: OnComplete(res)
    par 信用加分
        HK->>DB: 事务: credit +1 + 流水
    and 违约场景对照(超时未签到时)
        HK->>DB: 事务: credit -8 + 流水 + 禁约判断
        HK->>DB: INSERT violation 通知
    end
    LS-->>RH: 成功
    RH-->>V: {action: completed}
    V-->>U: 显示「已完成」, 信用分+1
